From 5498d1d10b974d875edb06775c2870e8ce996e90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: marvin <marvin@local>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 23:03:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v0.1 social club greybox + EP1-01 core foundation systems

v0.1: social club level (bar room, dogleg hallway, back room), InteractPressed/E
input, PlayerInteractor, InteractableNPC (C), DialogueUI, dogleg wall fix
(Wall_HallA_E split + north cap), Player tag, choice-key input bindings.

EP1-01: branching DialogueController + Ep1DialogueBank (C/Mook/Father trees),
ObjectiveManager (HUD + waypoint beacon), MissionStateMachine (Ep1Step,
trigger volumes, C-talk completion -> objective/step/checkpoint),
SaveManager (PlayerPrefs JSON checkpoint), TriggerVolume, dialogue movement
freeze. Temp DebugPositionLogger still present (verification only).
